<title>USA: MBIA qualifies four bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies four bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said it qualified four bond issues for insurance slated for sale today.</p>
<p>--Newark, N.J., $15.1 million refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--New Rochelle City School District, N.Y., $17.2 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Frontier CSD, N.Y., $9.5 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--South Fayette Township School District, Pa., $2.5 million and $7.5 million of GO and refunding bonds under alternate bidding program.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
